name: |-
  京东比价
desc: |-
  京东App历史价格（商品详情页面触发）表格，首次使用需安装慢慢买应用，之后点击进入[我的]页面以捕获Cookie，捕获成功后方可在商品详情页面查看比价内容。
icon: |-
  https://raw.githubusercontent.com/chxm1023/Script_X/main/icon/jd.png
arguments-desc: |-
  [参数设置]\n1. MMMCK_SCRIPT:JD_158 脚本前往慢慢买App获取Cookie\n2.避免不必要的重写，禁用请设置为"#"
category: "Tools"
http:

  mitm:
    - "in.m.jd.com"
    - "apapia-sqk-weblogic.manmanbuy.com"

  script:
    - match: ^https?:\/\/apapia-sqk-weblogic\.manmanbuy\.com\/baoliao\/center\/menu$
      name: "JD_158"
      type: request
      require-body: true
      max-size: -1
      timeout: 60

    - match: ^https?:\/\/in\.m\.jd\.com\/product\/graphext\/\d+\.html
      name: "JD_158"
      type: response
      require-body: true
      max-size: -1
      timeout: 60

script-providers:
  "JD_158":
    url: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zf2026/stash/refs/heads/main/script/jd_price.js
    interval: 86400
